# LIQUID-02 — Limit loops with limit: or pagination

## Rationale

Unbounded loops over collections can render hundreds of items and blow the Liquid
render budget.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check liquid-performance <file>
```

Flags `for` over `.products`/`collections`/`all_products` without `limit:` or
`paginate`.

## How to fix

Propose adding `limit:` or wrapping in `{% paginate %}`.

## Examples

### Bad

```liquid
{% for product in collection.products %}
  {% render 'product-card', product: product %}
{% endfor %}
```

### Good

```liquid
{% paginate collection.products by 24 %}
  {% for product in collection.products %}
    {% render 'product-card', title: product.title, url: product.url %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endpaginate %}
```
